{
  "id": "the-simpsons---5x22---secrets-of-a-successful-marriage",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 5x22 - Secrets of a Successful Marriage",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 5x22 - Secrets of a Successful Marriage.en.sub",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-13T03:32:08.135Z",
  "lineCount": 287,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[ Chorus ] \" The Simpsons \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2340,
      "endMs": 4600
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 8490,
      "endMs": 9440
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "All right, I raise a quarter. I'm out. - I'm out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 26540,
      "endMs": 29340
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "I'm out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 29340,
      "endMs": 31170
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Homer,you want any cards? Homer!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 31170,
      "endMs": 33830
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Whoo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 35590,
      "endMs": 36990
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Don't try to eat these so-called ''chips.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37270,
      "endMs": 39320
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Do you want another card or not? Huh? Okay. I'll take three.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39320,
      "endMs": 42640
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "D'oh! D'oh! D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 42640,
      "endMs": 44970
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Uh, I mean, whoo-hoo.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 45250,
      "endMs": 47110
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "I'm in. Let's see your cards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47110,
      "endMs": 49690
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Oh, I was bluffing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49690,
      "endMs": 52270
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Come to papa! Wait a minute.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 52330,
      "endMs": 55600
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "You have a straight flush, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55600,
      "endMs": 57510
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "G'oh! You do this every time, ya-- Oh, you--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57510,
      "endMs": 61480
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Chokin' on my own rage, here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 63210,
      "endMs": 64770
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Hey, don't yell at Homer just 'cause he's a little slow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 64770,
      "endMs": 68880
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "[ Thinking ] Something was said. Not good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 68880,
      "endMs": 70970
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "What was it? ''Don't yell at Homer''!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 70970,
      "endMs": 73420
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "No, that's okay. What was it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73420,
      "endMs": 75800
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "''Slow.'' They called you ''slow''!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 75800,
      "endMs": 79120
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "How dare you call me that? I-- Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 79380,
      "endMs": 82390
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Hey, Homer,you still here? Boy,you are slow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82390,
      "endMs": 86210
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "[Thinking ] Something said. Not good. Get the hell out of here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86210,
      "endMs": 89620
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "[ Door Slams ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 89900,
      "endMs": 91160
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "So anyhoo, last night we're playin' poker, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 95570,
      "endMs": 98660
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "As usual, I'm winning and not realizing it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 98660,
      "endMs": 101400
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "And Lenny says that I'm, uh-- get this-- ''a little slow''!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 101400,
      "endMs": 111450
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "How come you're not laughing? Do you think I'm slow?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115090,
      "endMs": 118460
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Buh. Snuh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118460,
      "endMs": 121090
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Oh, who am I kidding?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122440,
      "endMs": 123840
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "I am slow. Oh, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123840,
      "endMs": 126870
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "If you feel so bad about yourself, there's always things you can do to feel better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126870,
      "endMs": 131290
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "Take another bath in malt liquor? There's that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 131290,
      "endMs": 133960
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "Or you could take an adult education course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133960,
      "endMs": 136920
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Oh, and how is ''education'' supposed to make me feel smarter?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136920,
      "endMs": 141730
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Besides, every time I learn something new, it pushes some old stuff out of my brain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141730,
      "endMs": 146410
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Remember when I took that home wine-making course and I forgot how to drive?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 146410,
      "endMs": 150070
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "That's because you were drunk! And how.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 150070,
      "endMs": 153260
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "One way to drive your man wild... is to wear tight, revealing clothes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163450,
      "endMs": 167980
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Eww! At this point I'd like to remind you... there are no refunds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 168400,
      "endMs": 173640
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "You see, that ping sound means the spit was on target.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 177960,
      "endMs": 181160
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "Now you try.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181160,
      "endMs": 184010
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Gettin' better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 186520,
      "endMs": 187520
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Even Lenny is teaching a class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 188200,
      "endMs": 191520
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Look at the way they admire and adore him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 191890,
      "endMs": 194680
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "That's it. If he can teach a class, he can teach a class!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196810,
      "endMs": 201260
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "I mean, I can teach a class!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201260,
      "endMs": 203700
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "What is your area of expertise?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 204610,
      "endMs": 206530
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I can tell the difference between butter and I Can't Believe It's Not Butter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 206810,
      "endMs": 210070
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "No, you can't, Mr. Simpson. No one can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210070,
      "endMs": 212400
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Oh, I failed again. Everybody can teach a class but me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212400,
      "endMs": 216000
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I'm an idiot. What am I gonna tell my wife and kids?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 216360,
      "endMs": 219510
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Oh, you're married? - That depends. Is there another way to get this job?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219810,
      "endMs": 223560
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "No. Mr. Simpson, what I mean is we may have a job for you after all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 223980,
      "endMs": 228110
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "We need someone to teach a course on how to build a successful marriage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 228400,
      "endMs": 231210
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "I'll do it! Anything to get me out of that house... away from all that nagging and noise... uh, of a family of love. \" Sha-la-la-la \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231460,
      "endMs": 241170
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Look, everyone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 244640,
      "endMs": 245940
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Now that I'm a teacher, I've sewed patches on my elbows. - Homer... that's supposed to be leather patches on a tweed blazer, not the other way around.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246070,
      "endMs": 255360
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "You've ruined a perfectly good jacket.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 255590,
      "endMs": 258310
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Ah, incorrect, Marge-- two perfectly good jackets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258590,
      "endMs": 262600
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "I think it's great you're a teacher, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263100,
      "endMs": 265040
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "So, will you be lecturing from a standardized text... or using the more Socratic method of interactive class participation?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 265370,
      "endMs": 271020
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Yes, Lisa. Daddy's a teacher.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 271970,
      "endMs": 275430
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "[ Doorbell Rings ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 279040,
      "endMs": 280320
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Oh, Homer. What a pleasant-- Can't talk now, Flanders. I've got a class to teach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280780,
      "endMs": 286450
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "But you rang my--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286790,
      "endMs": 288610
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Can I take your order? Nothing for me today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 290610,
      "endMs": 293450
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "I've got a class to teach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293450,
      "endMs": 296140
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Sir, it's a felony to tease the order box.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 296470,
      "endMs": 298900
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "It's all right. I'm a teacher!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302440,
      "endMs": 305240
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "I didn't know we could do that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 305830,
      "endMs": 308640
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308940,
      "endMs": 310270
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "All right. The first thing they told me to do... was to make sure everyone here is in the right class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316170,
      "endMs": 321420
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Down the hall, Room 12. Thank you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322020,
      "endMs": 324190
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Ew. Okay. Let's get started. Uh... um... uh-h-h-m...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 324190,
      "endMs": 333640
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "hmm-- No talking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 334440,
      "endMs": 338440
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Uh-- How about if we tell you our problems with relationships?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 339750,
      "endMs": 345080
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah! That'll eat up some time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345080,
      "endMs": 348590
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Uh-h-h-m, how about you, Otto?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 348890,
      "endMs": 352250
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Oh, my standards are just too high, you know?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352250,
      "endMs": 356000
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "I feel like nobody's good enough for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356280,
      "endMs": 358860
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Whoa. You think you got 'em all, but you forget about the eggs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 360080,
      "endMs": 363800
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "My problem is I'm a real user of women. I move in right away and stay until the money's gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364090,
      "endMs": 369050
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Well, I'm a smart woman, but I make bad choices.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369050,
      "endMs": 371720
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "[ Whispering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 372050,
      "endMs": 373620
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Okay. Here's a set of house keys and my A.T.M. card.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 375540,
      "endMs": 378230
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Um, I was married once, but, uh, I just didn't know how to keep it together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 378630,
      "endMs": 383240
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Come on, Waylon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386530,
      "endMs": 388390
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Make love to me the way you used to. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388390,
      "endMs": 392020
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "It's that horrible Mr. Burns, isn't it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392020,
      "endMs": 394900
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "You leave Mr. Burns out of this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 395170,
      "endMs": 397790
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Smithers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 398920,
      "endMs": 400920
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Smi-thers!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404410,
      "endMs": 407400
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Mmm. Ooh, Mr. Simpson, are you listening?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408950,
      "endMs": 411630
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Simpson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412720,
      "endMs": 413770
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Huh? Yeah, I was listening. Very funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414110,
      "endMs": 416330
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Oh, ya were not. You were just eatin' a damn orange.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 416330,
      "endMs": 419090
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Oh, yes, yes. To the untrained eye, I'm eating an orange... but to the eye that has brains, I'm making a point about marriage.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 419450,
      "endMs": 427020
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "For you see, marriage is a lot like an orange.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 427640,
      "endMs": 431320
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "First you have the skin... then the sweet, sweet innards.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 431700,
      "endMs": 436770
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I don't understand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442540,
      "endMs": 444480
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "This is terrible. We're leaving.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445350,
      "endMs": 448150
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Ach, let's get out of here. This is a terrible excuse for education.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448500,
      "endMs": 451190
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "Oh, I told Marge this wouldn't work the other night in bed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 451530,
      "endMs": 454480
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "In bed? Well. Huh? Huh? - What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 454480,
      "endMs": 456670
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "So somethin' wasn't workin' in bed, huh? Heh, heh, heh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 456670,
      "endMs": 460000
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "No, that's not what I meant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 460300,
      "endMs": 462000
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Marge and I always talk things over in bed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 462360,
      "endMs": 464730
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Like the other night, we were fighting about money. - Ooh, a fight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 464730,
      "endMs": 467830
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Trouble in paradise, huh? Heh, heh, heh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467830,
      "endMs": 471350
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "I was telling Marge that we could save some money... if she only dyed her hair once a month.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 471350,
      "endMs": 476510
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Marge dyes her hair? Oh, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476510,
      "endMs": 478280
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "She's been as gray as a mule since she was 17.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478540,
      "endMs": 481290
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Come on. Tell us more. Tell us about it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 481290,
      "endMs": 484880
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "I went on for hours, and they were hanging on my every word.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 485490,
      "endMs": 489110
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "I really think I was born to teach.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489530,
      "endMs": 491500
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "All right, Simpson. You were warned about teasing the box.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491800,
      "endMs": 494680
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Wait! I need closure on that anecdote.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497350,
      "endMs": 500200
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Oh, Mrs. Simpson, it may interest you to know... we are having a sale on blue dye number 52.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508130,
      "endMs": 513720
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "It is your hair color, I believe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 513720,
      "endMs": 515790
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Whatever do you mean? I don't dye my hair.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 516200,
      "endMs": 520720
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "Nah, nah, nah. You got it wrong, 'Pu.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 520720,
      "endMs": 522910
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "She's blue 56. I don't know what you're talking about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522910,
      "endMs": 525860
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "We just love your husband's class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525860,
      "endMs": 528410
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "That's nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528410,
      "endMs": 530510
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Homer, I really don't like you telling personal secrets in your class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532900,
      "endMs": 536850
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Marge, I didn't tell 'em personal stuff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537170,
      "endMs": 539720
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Today at the Kwik-E-Mart everybody knew I dyed my hair. - Oh. You mean about you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 540030,
      "endMs": 544370
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "All right, maybe I said some things, some personal things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544370,
      "endMs": 547820
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "But you should've seen 'em, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 547820,
      "endMs": 549890
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "They really wanted to hear what I had to say. Mmm. I'm happy about that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 550240,
      "endMs": 553040
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "But I think you can be a good teacher and still respect our privacy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 553040,
      "endMs": 556900
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "Look, Marge. You don't know what it's like. I'm the one out there putting his ass on the line.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 557200,
      "endMs": 561200
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "And I'm not out of order. You're out of order! The whole freakin' system is out of order.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561490,
      "endMs": 566140
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "You want the truth? You want the truth? You can't handle the truth!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 566470,
      "endMs": 570830
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "'Cause when you reach over and put your hand into a pile of goo... that was your best friend's face, you'll know what to do!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571140,
      "endMs": 578660
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Forget it, Marge. It's Chinatown!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579020,
      "endMs": 582670
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Homer, don't ever tell them personal stuff about me again! -Yes, ma'am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582950,
      "endMs": 586920
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Now, what is a wedding? Well, Webster's Dictionary describes a wedding as...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 587160,
      "endMs": 592160
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "''the process of removing weeds from one's garden.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 592430,
      "endMs": 595930
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Tell us more about you and Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 597530,
      "endMs": 599520
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "This is a place of learning, not a house of... hearing about things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599860,
      "endMs": 603810
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Guess he's run out of stories.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605260,
      "endMs": 606640
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "What a rip-off. I can't believe I paid $10,000 for this course.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606800,
      "endMs": 611560
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "What the heck was that lab fee for?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 612070,
      "endMs": 614090
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "No. Wait. Uh, um-- Wait. I-- Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614410,
      "endMs": 617420
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "I do have a story about two other young marrieds.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617710,
      "endMs": 622140
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Now, the wife of this couple has an interesting quirk in the bedroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625240,
      "endMs": 629820
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "It seems she goes wild with desire if her husband nibbles on her elbow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630160,
      "endMs": 634640
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "We need names! Well, let's just call 'em, uh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634940,
      "endMs": 638510
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Mr. ''X'' and Mrs. ''Y.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638840,
      "endMs": 641660
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "So, anyway, Mr. ''X'' would say, ''Marge, if this doesn't get your motor running... my name isn't Homer J. Simpson.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641900,
      "endMs": 649100
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Huh? Ooh, Homer, don't you have to get to class?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653650,
      "endMs": 656170
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "Not tonight, Marge. Tonight we can eat a nice, leisurely dinner at home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 656420,
      "endMs": 661220
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Oh. Well, that will be l--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 661930,
      "endMs": 663650
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "What the darn? Marge, you'll never guess what.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 665400,
      "endMs": 668450
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "My whole class is here. They're going to observe the human peep show... that is our lives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668870,
      "endMs": 674160
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Apparently, that disturbing odor was the food.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674940,
      "endMs": 678570
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "So, little Lisa, apple of my eye... how are things down at the old schoolhouse?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 680080,
      "endMs": 686130
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "I find this demeaning and embarrassing beyond my worst nightmares.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 686420,
      "endMs": 689730
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "And how's my little major leaguer? Catch any june bugs today?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 691940,
      "endMs": 695990
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Me and Milhouse took some mail from a mail truck and threw it down the sewer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696280,
      "endMs": 699690
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Son, I know you meant well, but that wasn't the right thing to do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700040,
      "endMs": 704030
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "What the hell are you talkin' about? You're the one who double-dared us.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704340,
      "endMs": 707230
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Why, you little-- Ooh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 707530,
      "endMs": 709320
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Homer! I'm outta here. - Me too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709320,
      "endMs": 712370
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "Well, now that the little ones have toddled off to bed-- I want this to end now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716590,
      "endMs": 723310
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Hey, Homer. Why don't you just nibble her elbow?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 723670,
      "endMs": 726490
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "That always melts her butter, right? Heh, heh, heh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 726850,
      "endMs": 730000
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731220,
      "endMs": 732310
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Okay. Everybody out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 732580,
      "endMs": 734800
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Ooh, she's gotta have it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 735160,
      "endMs": 737410
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Get out! Get out! Get out! Get out! Get out-out-out-out-out-out-out!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737640,
      "endMs": 740310
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "All right, we're breaking early tonight, class.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741440,
      "endMs": 743400
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "For tomorrow, you should read pages seven through 18 in Lisa's diary. - You too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743640,
      "endMs": 747160
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Get out! But I'm not in the cla--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 747750,
      "endMs": 749840
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Is any of this gonna be on the test? 'Cause I wasn't payin' attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752740,
      "endMs": 756740
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Come on, Marge. Let me in! There's crickets out here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761240,
      "endMs": 765840
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Okay, Marge. Things were said. Mistakes were made.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769150,
      "endMs": 771690
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Let's end this madness and get on with our lives.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771980,
      "endMs": 774230
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "You just don't get it, do you, Homer?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774600,
      "endMs": 776910
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "You told personal things about our lives, even after you promised you wouldn't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777260,
      "endMs": 780940
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I can't trust you anymore. But I learned my lesson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781210,
      "endMs": 784340
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "It'll never happen again. Hey, Homer. What's the big brouhaha-ha?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 784640,
      "endMs": 788570
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Ah, Marge is throwin' me out for blabbin' about her elbow thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 788980,
      "endMs": 792060
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Honey, the door blew shut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793180,
      "endMs": 795790
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Oh. Fine. If that's what you want, you've got it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797340,
      "endMs": 800920
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "This scene is gettin' old, man. I'm hittin' the road.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 801380,
      "endMs": 804660
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Maybe I'll drop you a line someday from wherever I wind up in this crazy old world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804950,
      "endMs": 810240
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Kids, your father and I are going through a really tough time right now... and I don't know what's going to happen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813300,
      "endMs": 820270
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "But just remember that both your mom and your dad love you very, very much.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820560,
      "endMs": 824620
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Wow, I've never seen Mom so mad at Homer before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826220,
      "endMs": 829550
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "I'll tell you a secret, Bart. Every time I'm worried about Mom and Dad...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 829840,
      "endMs": 832870
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "I go to the attic and add to my ball of string.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 833170,
      "endMs": 836110
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Earth base, this is Commander Bart McCool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 841020,
      "endMs": 843140
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "We are under attack by the Zorrinid brain changers.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 843380,
      "endMs": 845350
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Quickly, into the safety dome, Milbot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 845620,
      "endMs": 847430
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "Affirmative, humanoid.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 848270,
      "endMs": 850250
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Ew!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851490,
      "endMs": 852870
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Don't mind me, boys. Just scrubbin' my undies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 853370,
      "endMs": 855530
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Sorry, Bart. Your dad kinda blew the fantasy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855800,
      "endMs": 859260
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "I only like it when I'm pretend-scared.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859600,
      "endMs": 862230
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Keep up the roughhousing, Son.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862530,
      "endMs": 864200
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Without a strong male presence in the house, you could turn sissy overnight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864460,
      "endMs": 868380
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Oh, these stubborn grass stains.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 868980,
      "endMs": 871280
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Oh, good. Reverend Lovejoy will make Marge take me back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875070,
      "endMs": 877810
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "He has to push the sanctity of marriage, or his god will punish him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878140,
      "endMs": 882370
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Get a divorce. Mm-hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882690,
      "endMs": 884480
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "But isn't that a sin? Marge, just about everything is a sin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 884710,
      "endMs": 888570
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "You ever sat down and read this thing?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888850,
      "endMs": 890870
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Technically, we're not allowed to go go the bathroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891130,
      "endMs": 893610
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Good night, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899780,
      "endMs": 901520
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Oh, why didn't I take a picture?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903400,
      "endMs": 905170
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "I had ten years to take a picture.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905370,
      "endMs": 907620
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Hmm. Funny the way everything reminds me of Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908170,
      "endMs": 911900
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "I love you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921760,
      "endMs": 923190
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Will you marry me, Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924070,
      "endMs": 925860
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "You mean, I'm gonna be a daddy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 926790,
      "endMs": 928690
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I hope we'll always be together, together, together-- Together?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 929170,
      "endMs": 935890
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Ooh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938260,
      "endMs": 939350
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Here, Dad. I brought you some nice-- Good news, Lisa. I don't need your mother anymore.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942980,
      "endMs": 948700
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "I've created a replacement that's superior to her in almost every way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 949070,
      "endMs": 952970
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Dad, that's just a plant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953650,
      "endMs": 955490
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "Lisa! You will respect your new mother. Now, give her a kiss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 955760,
      "endMs": 959130
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Kiss her!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 959460,
      "endMs": 961790
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Oh-my-God! Oh-my-God! Oh-my-God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 963150,
      "endMs": 964860
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "All right. Let's get our stories straight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965270,
      "endMs": 967830
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "She tripped, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 968150,
      "endMs": 969980
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Look. I brought you some nice pudding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970540,
      "endMs": 973260
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Ah, your flesh mother used to bring me pudding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973570,
      "endMs": 976820
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Oh, I miss Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 977530,
      "endMs": 979480
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Lisa, you're smart. Help me trick her into taking me back.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 979790,
      "endMs": 982600
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Dad, you can't trick somebody into loving you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982940,
      "endMs": 985420
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "There's a reason two people come together and stay together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985740,
      "endMs": 988440
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "There's something they give each other that nobody else can give them.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 988730,
      "endMs": 991510
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "If you want Mom back, you just have to remember what you give her that nobody else can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 991810,
      "endMs": 995810
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "I'll pay you $40 if you think of it for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996940,
      "endMs": 999050
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "No. Okay. 30.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999350,
      "endMs": 1001410
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Good luck, Dad.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002500,
      "endMs": 1004470
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "All right, brain. It's all up to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004780,
      "endMs": 1007080
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "If you don't think of what it is, we'll lose Marge forever.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007350,
      "endMs": 1010400
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Oh. H-Hi, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1015510,
      "endMs": 1017130
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "I heard you and Homer broke up, so I'm declarin' my intentions to move in on his territory.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017370,
      "endMs": 1022520
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Here, I, uh, brung ya some posies. Oh, my.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1023170,
      "endMs": 1027140
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "I'm very flattered, but I'm not really interested.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1027770,
      "endMs": 1031300
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Sheesh. I come here, I get dressed up all nice-like... put my heart on the line, and I make a fool of myself.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031840,
      "endMs": 1038620
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Oh, boy. Oh, I'm gonna start bawlin' here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040180,
      "endMs": 1043810
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Hmm, why don't you come inside for a drink of water? - 'Kay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044150,
      "endMs": 1047900
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Hmm. Clean house, no silverfish.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051690,
      "endMs": 1054820
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Could've been very happy here. [ Knocking ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055310,
      "endMs": 1057940
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Homer. Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1058710,
      "endMs": 1060110
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "What are you doin' here? I, um-- Well, I--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1061890,
      "endMs": 1064520
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "I never touched her. Homer, I swear, I never touched her. - Here's your water, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1064830,
      "endMs": 1067970
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "I didn't ask her for no water. She's lyin', Homer. She told me you were dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068220,
      "endMs": 1071330
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "That's the only reason I-- I didn't do nothin'!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071330,
      "endMs": 1074120
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Bye, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1076180,
      "endMs": 1077470
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Homer, what happened to you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1077700,
      "endMs": 1079400
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Marge, I figured out what I can give you that no one else can: a bouquet of po-- ohhh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1079670,
      "endMs": 1086300
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "I give up. I don't deserve to live with you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086800,
      "endMs": 1090540
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093640,
      "endMs": 1094920
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Oh. My tattered rags... are caught on your coffee table.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098100,
      "endMs": 1103730
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Oh, here. Let me help you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1104050,
      "endMs": 1106560
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Wait, that's it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1113270,
      "endMs": 1114940
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "I know now what I can offer you that no one else can: complete and utter dependence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115320,
      "endMs": 1121240
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Homer, that's not a good thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1121520,
      "endMs": 1123540
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Are you kidding? It's a wondrous, marvelous thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1123790,
      "endMs": 1127420
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "Marge, I need you more than anyone else on this entire planet... could possibly ever need you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127720,
      "endMs": 1133250
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "I need you to take care of me, to put up with me... and most of all, I need you to love me, because I love you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1133600,
      "endMs": 1140810
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "But how do I know I can trust you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1142980,
      "endMs": 1145700
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Marge, look at me. We've been separated for a day, and I'm as dirty as a Frenchman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145960,
      "endMs": 1150270
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "In another few hours I'll be dead. I can't afford to lose your trust again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150540,
      "endMs": 1154920
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1165940,
      "endMs": 1167370
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "I must admit. You really do make a gal feel needed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168540,
      "endMs": 1173030
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Wait till my class hears about this. Kidding!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173330,
      "endMs": 1176170
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "Oh, it's great to be indoors with my family.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177130,
      "endMs": 1181070
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "I'm really glad you're back, Dad. I knew you could do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1181440,
      "endMs": 1184750
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Now don't screw it up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185760,
      "endMs": 1187600
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Look, Dad. I missed you so much, I couldn't concentrate in school and I got an ''F.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187860,
      "endMs": 1192270
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Hey, this is dated two weeks ago.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1192600,
      "endMs": 1194410
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Oh. Sorry. Here's a fresh one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194720,
      "endMs": 1196740
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "And I have a special present for you, but I'll give it to you later tonight.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197010,
      "endMs": 1201670
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Special present? I don't wanna wait. I want it now! I want the children to see.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202140,
      "endMs": 1206280
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Ooh. Oh, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1206810,
      "endMs": 1209140
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Later.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209400,
      "endMs": 1210930
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "So, Marge, are you really happy? Really?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212670,
      "endMs": 1214660
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "Hey, Moe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214960,
      "endMs": 1216940
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 5,
    "episode": 22
  }
}
